<title>UK: Enterprise, Pennzoil in oil find.</title>
<headline>Enterprise, Pennzoil in oil find.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>British oil exploration group Enterprise Oil Plc said on Tuesday it made a crude oil discovery in the Garden Banks No 1 well in the U.S. Gulf of Mexico.</p>
<p>Enterprise said Garden Banks was operated by Pennzoil Company through a farm-in arrangement. It said the well would not be flow tested but would be suspended for future development.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
